      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The first permanent settlement in Echo began with James Bromley’s 1854 stage station, marking the town’s earliest commercial foothold.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        28,
        29
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
